"Hold Fn and press 1 to 9 to dictate in a specific mode (1 Flow, 2 Intent, …). The mode you pick sticks for next time." = "按住 Fn 并按 1 to 9，即可用指定模式听写（1 Flow、2 Intent、…）。所选模式会保留到下次。";
"Switch mode on the fly" = "随时切换模式";
"Fn + Tab → next mode, Fn + ⇧ + Tab → previous — even mid-sentence while holding Fn. ⌃ (Control) pauses & resumes, ⌥ (Option) also switches mode, Esc cancels." = "Fn + Tab → 下一个模式，Fn + ⇧ + Tab → 上一个 — 即使按住 Fn 说到一半也行。⌃ (Control) 暂停与恢复，⌥ (Option) 同样可切换模式，Esc 取消。";
"No AI" = "无 AI";
"Smart" = "智能";
"Pro" = "Pro";
"Vision" = "视觉";
"Create your own" = "创建你自己的";
"Custom" = "自定义";
"Build a mode for exactly your need — describe it and Verba writes the prompt. Auto-switch it per app. In Settings ▸ Modes." = "打造完全契合你需求的模式 — 描述一下，Verba 就会写好提示词。可按应用自动切换。在 Settings ▸ Modes 中设置。";
"Every mode runs on the model you choose — a local model, your Claude/OpenAI/OpenRouter key, or your Claude plan. Adjustable anytime in Settings ▸ Modes." = "每种模式都运行在你选择的模型上 — 本地模型、你的 Claude/OpenAI/OpenRouter 密钥，或你的 Claude 套餐。可随时在 Settings ▸ Modes 中调整。";
"Context needs Screen Recording permission (you'll grant it on first use) and a vision-capable model." = "Context 需要屏幕录制权限（首次使用时授予）以及一个支持视觉的模型。";
"While a recording is running, press Control to pause — tap it again to resume." = "录音进行时，按 Control 暂停 — 再按一次恢复。";
"Verba turns every dictation into simple insight — and keeps your work within reach." = "Verba 把每次听写都化为简明洞察 — 让你的成果触手可及。";
"Words dictated, words-per-minute, streak and a daily chart — your flow at a glance." = "听写字数、每分钟字数、连续天数和每日图表 — 一眼看清你的状态。";
"History you can rework" = "可再加工的历史记录";
"Every dictation is saved and searchable. Reopen one and re-run it in another mode to reshape it. Audio replay is optional — keep or turn it off in Settings." = "每次听写都会保存并可搜索。重新打开某条，用另一种模式再跑一遍即可重塑。音频回放为可选 — 在 Settings 中保留或关闭。";
"Keep recorded audio" = "保留录制的音频";
"Audio is saved with each entry so you can replay it. Turn off to keep only the text and save disk space." = "音频会随每条记录一起保存，供你回放。关闭后仅保留文字，节省磁盘空间。";
"Off: your text history is still saved, but no audio is stored. Frees disk if you never replay recordings." = "关闭：文字记录依然保留，但不存储音频。若你从不回放录音，可释放磁盘空间。";
"All shortcuts" = "所有快捷键";
"Action — Fn + X" = "操作 — Fn + X";
"Speak a command and Verba acts for you across 1,000+ connected apps (send an email, create an event…). It always asks you to confirm before doing anything." = "说出一条指令，Verba 便会在 1,000+ 个已连接的应用中替你执行（发送邮件、创建事件…）。它在执行任何操作前都会先请你确认。";
"Note — Fn + Z" = "笔记 — Fn + Z";
"Record a long voice memo; Verba turns it into a clean, structured note." = "录制一段较长的语音备忘，Verba 会将其整理成清晰、有条理的笔记。";
"To-do — Fn + T" = "待办 — Fn + T";
"Capture a task by voice (Fn + § on ISO keyboards). “Pay the invoice Friday at 6pm.”" = "用语音记录一项任务（ISO 键盘上为 Fn + §）。“周五下午 6 点支付发票。”";
"Today's to-dos — ⌥ + Fn" = "今日待办 — ⌥ + Fn";
"Glance at what's due today without leaving what you're doing." = "无需中断手头的工作，即可快速查看今天要做的事。";
"Transform selection — ⌥ + X" = "转换选中内容 — ⌥ + X";
"Select any text in any app, then ⌥ + X to rewrite, translate or restyle it." = "在任意应用中选中任意文本，然后按 ⌥ + X 即可重写、翻译或重新润色。";
"Switch style — Fn + ] / Fn + [" = "切换风格 — Fn + ] / Fn + [";
"Cycle the tone/format layer (next / previous) on top of the active mode." = "在当前模式之上循环切换语气/格式层（下一个 / 上一个）。";
"Pause · switch · cancel" = "暂停 · 切换 · 取消";
"⌃ (Control) pauses & resumes, ⌥ (Option) switches mode mid-sentence, Esc cancels — any time you're recording." = "录制过程中随时可用：⌃ (Control) 暂停与继续，⌥ (Option) 在句中切换模式，Esc 取消。";
"Still seeing the macOS emoji / keyboard popup? Turn it off in System Settings ▸ Keyboard ▸ “Press 🌐 key to” → Do Nothing." = "仍然弹出 macOS 表情符号 / 键盘弹窗？前往 System Settings ▸ Keyboard ▸ “Press 🌐 key to” → 关闭即可。";
"All Notes" = "全部笔记";
"Untagged" = "未标记";
"No untagged notes" = "没有未标记的笔记";
"Pick another tag, or All Notes to see every note." = "选择其他标签，或选「全部笔记」查看所有笔记。";
"Words Spoken" = "已说字数";
"Dictations" = "听写次数";
"Streaks" = "连续记录";
"Dedication" = "坚持不懈";
"Speed" = "语速";
"Big Days" = "高产日";
"Time Saved" = "节省时间";
"Airtime" = "开口时长";
"Modes & Features" = "模式与功能";
"Special" = "特别成就";
"Custom pause / resume shortcut" = "自定义暂停 / 继续快捷键";
"Custom cancel shortcut" = "自定义取消快捷键";
"Your trigger is everything: tap or hold to dictate, then ⌃ to pause and ⎋ to cancel. You can add your own pause/cancel shortcut above — the defaults keep working." = "触发键就是一切：轻点或长按即可开始口述，然后按 ⌃ 暂停、按 ⎋ 取消。你可以在上方添加自己的暂停/取消快捷键 — 默认快捷键仍然有效。";
"Pick the keystroke that starts and stops a dictation. ⌃ pauses, ⎋ cancels — and you can rebind any of them above." = "选择用于开始和停止口述的按键。⌃ 暂停，⎋ 取消 — 你也可以在上方重新绑定其中任意一个。";
"Locked note" = "已锁定的笔记";
"This note is protected. Enter its password to read it." = "此笔记受保护。请输入密码以阅读。";
"Password" = "密码";
"Wrong password. Try again." = "密码错误，请重试。";
"Unlock" = "解锁";
"Remove password…" = "移除密码…";
"Protected" = "受保护";
"Unlock to read" = "解锁以阅读";
"Lock with password…" = "用密码锁定…";
"Protect this note" = "保护此笔记";
"Choose a password for this note. Each note can have its own. Without it, the note can't be read — there's no recovery, so keep it safe." = "为此笔记设置一个密码。每条笔记都可以有各自的密码。没有密码就无法阅读笔记 — 且无法找回，请妥善保管。";
"Confirm password" = "确认密码";
"Passwords don't match." = "两次输入的密码不一致。";
"Lock note" = "锁定笔记";
